{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Iriora 是一款專為 iPhone 與 iPad 用戶而設的相片清理工具，透過裝置端分析找出模糊照片、相似或重複影像與大型影片，協助釋放儲存空間。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，適合想整理相簿及節省容量的使用者。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-230.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>智能分析相片品質</h2>\n<p>以分數和理由提供 AI 清理建議，並將相似相片分組供全尺寸預覽；精確重複項目與大型影片另有列表。你可標記待清理項目、保留最愛，確認刪除前檢視或撤銷選擇。另可按日期、相簿或隨機樣本瀏覽，並為支援的相片、Live Photos 與影片建立較小副本。分析在裝置上進行，毋須帳戶、廣告或追蹤。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-230-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-231-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-232-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-233-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-234-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Iriora: AI Photo Cleaner</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/iriora-ai-photo-cleaner/id6797684994?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T21:38:40.893491+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":330,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T21:16:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T22:37:54.333352+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T21:32:07.895719+00:00","content_hash":"bd7667592451c33a5497994549327d89262401027ac26847cb2391c953a96948","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}